{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_06_beg","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_06","title":"怒意漫延","storyCode":"TW-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4784534e0296591eba7f1042081f6b0c44e1707c8baff2f32715661f3a68083f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 6上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（頭好暈......！視野......聽力......還算正常。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（腳踝......失去知覺了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（......好安靜，其他人都離開了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的好安靜......等等，敵人就這麼把我放在這兒了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......別這麼緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、抱歉！突然被嚇了一跳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？您、您是？我記得，您也是羅德島的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員，灰喉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"小聲點，這附近的叛亂者都被解決掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"解決......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......即使到了這個時候，你還是不希望把他們視作敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，基本都性命無憂，已經交給塞弗林·霍索恩長官了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——亞葉小姐她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒事，其他幹員去幫她了，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"安托她真的......犧牲了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"所以亞葉才會是那副模樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"只靠幾名幹員不可能收復這片街區，我們應該先撤回城鎮中心，重整旗鼓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你能走嗎？你的腳踝受傷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我試試看，疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"來，手給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——還有一個問題，塔佳娜小姐。我陪著安托抵達這裡的時候，沃倫姆德還是一片繁榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但為什麼現在，沃倫姆德連一個正規憲兵都沒有？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"放下武器，看看你自己，連套像樣的裝備都沒有，就這樣也打算戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些外來者，到底懂什麼！幫那些貴族爪牙，你們到底有什麼好處！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有好處，我也對你們的政治不感興趣，但是......你是冬靈人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"冬靈人——？哈，我才不是那種土著，但我的確認可他們的抗爭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你們呢？安托醫生是個好傢伙，但你們呢？你們只是在幫他們落井下石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德——不，整個萊塔尼亞都是腐朽的！他們今天敢放火害死感染者，明天就會放火燒死所有的窮人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"證據呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——沃倫姆德一個憲兵都沒有！一個！都沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道為什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德和周遭的多個城鎮組成了聚落，天災來臨，憲兵數量並不足以照顧到所有的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我呸！要真是這麼正常的理由，誰會不滿！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——別想拖延時間，說，還是不說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"因為一場婚禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......婚禮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"因為某個身居高塔之上的大貴族迎娶了另一位貴族的獨女，所有的憲兵都被調往了最近的移動城邦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族的酒池肉林持續了多久？你猜猜看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，貴族們還爭吵著哪一方才該開動移動城市去另一方的領土做客，爭執了一個月之久——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的憲兵隊就那麼被扣押在貴族的宅邸周圍，為了排面和名義上的安保，滑稽嗎？可笑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——一點都不可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"的確一點都不可笑，但我依舊沒有聽見關於火災的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......你覺得，誰會放火燒掉一座醫治感染者的醫療營地？感染者自己嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"只有那些見不得感染者的人才會做這種事，你應該信任的人是我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——信任“整合運動”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！叛徒們不願意投降——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的人並不多......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但這場災難真正可怕的地方在於，雙方都不是戰士，都只是普通的市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該竭力避免最壞的情況發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉前輩！塔佳娜小姐！你們回來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......而我們要讓這一切的罪魁禍首付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父......抱歉，我疏忽了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，你沒事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員亞葉......你也平安無事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉......對，是你陪著安托抵達沃倫姆德的，我有印象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道發生什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......大致瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得......如果你在她的身邊，能避免這場悲劇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉，你不該——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。沃倫姆德所展露出的多樣性矛盾有外力無法解決的困難，我們無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......但至少，我該陪著她竭盡全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我沒陪在她身邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不......唉，只是為了讓自己好受點還要為難你的，我到底在做什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"該道歉的人是我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"先容我道一句謝，感謝羅德島救下了塔佳娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島，是救助感染者為己任的組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林·霍索恩，因為萊塔尼亞一直以來的舉措的確讓人鬆懈，但我依舊要問，要在我們正式開始行動之前質詢你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否能代表沃倫姆德，保證沃倫姆德沒有在特殊情況下，對感染者採取了“額外措施”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......鈴蘭小姐和你的調查應該可以佐證這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德絕無針對感染者的意思，也絕不會因此對救助感染者的安托醫生懷恨在心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你能滿意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐，我相信塞弗林長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......那個......還不能說！但是我相信他！他不是會針對感染者的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩......那麼，我暫且相信你的態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我想聽聽各位的意見，下一步該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......我對現場的情況瞭解並不如亞葉幹員，作戰任務時，我聽從亞葉幹員的指示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，人並不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"算上已經成功制伏的這些人，他們可能不過百來號人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"對於平常的沃倫姆德而言，百來個暴徒不足為懼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"關於憲兵的事情，我聽說了一些有趣的傳聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——那也是我從軍生涯中為數不多的荒誕決定，改變不了的事情能暫時擱置嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"容我打斷一下，告訴我們傳聞的那個俘虜，自稱“整合運動”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們曾經接觸過某個單獨的整合運動成員，他和這些因為各種原因義憤填膺的市民，完全沒有可比性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"他是個久經沙場的戰士，如果他那樣的傢伙有一支小隊，會很棘手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"那些武裝分子......這可不算什麼好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合運動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格的事......烏薩斯的事......啊，又是烏薩斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會信他們一個字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那場火災是一切的導火線，但到目前為止，衝突的可能性太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是這些問題導致了那場火災，還是那場火災暴露了這些問題，僅此而已？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們只能開戰了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......這將是敲定沃倫姆德命運的選擇。幾千條人命不能這麼草率地決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應當先回到議事廳做出正式決議。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......但是對方好像不太願意給我們這個機會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果他們真的是“整合運動”，我們不需要手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。但是亞葉幹員，你應當留在這裡治療傷患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我要親自——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩，鈴蘭幹員並不是正式的醫療幹員，只有你是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你應當優先保護無辜的民眾，而不是優先擊潰敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐......你應該留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果亞葉姐姐總是氣勢洶洶地戰鬥下去......就會變得不像是亞葉姐姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就......好吧，我......我留下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["斷崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
